```html
<!-- HTML -->
<div class="doboz">
  <img src="kep.jpg" alt="kép" id="kep">
</div>
```

```css
/* CSS */
.doboz {
  width: 400px;
  height: 250px;
  border: 2px solid black;
  overflow: hidden;            /* cut off anything that sticks out */
}

.doboz img {
  width: 100%;                 /* image as wide as the box */
