## 10. ⭐ Currency exchange (Pénzváltó)

> **How it works in plain words:**  
> 1. Read everything: name, amount, FROM currency (radio), TO currency (radio), discount (checkbox), fee (select)  
> 2. Check for mistakes: empty name? amount ≤ 0? no currency picked? → show error, STOP  
> 3. Convert **FROM → forint → TO** (every rate is "how many forints is 1 unit")  
> 4. Add the fee, apply the discount if ticked  
> 5. Show it with 2 decimals and a Hungarian comma

### The formula explained with an example: 100 EUR → USD

| Step                             | Code                              | Result     |
|----------------------------------|-----------------------------------|------------|
| EUR to forint (1 EUR = 363.6 Ft) | `100 * 363.6`                     | 36 360 Ft  |
| forint to USD (1 USD = 323.1 Ft) | `36360 / 323.1`                   | 112.54 USD |
| +2% fee                          | `112.54 * (1 + 2/100)` = `* 1.02` | 114.79     |
| -5% discount                     | `114.79 * 0.95`                   | 109.05     |

> 💡 **One line to memorize:** `atvaltott = osszeg * arfolyam(mirol) / arfolyam(mire);`  
> "multiply by the FROM rate, divide by the TO rate". HUF has rate 1, so HUF → EUR is just `/ 363.6`.

> 💡 **Percent trick:** +X% = `* (1 + X/100)`. −X% = `* (1 - X/100)`. So −5% = `* 0.95`, +2% = `* 1.02`. If your teacher says the fee is SUBTRACTED, use `(1 - dij / 100)`.

**Full working file**

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Pénzváltó</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: #dfe6f5;
  }
  .doboz {
    width: 450px;
    background-color: white;
    border: 2px solid black;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .sor { margin: 10px 0; }        /* space between the lines of the form */
  .hiba { color: red; font-weight: bold; }
  .jo { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="doboz">
  <h2>Pénzváltó</h2>

  <div class="sor">Név: <input type="text" id="nev"></div>
  <div class="sor">Összeg: <input type="number" id="osszeg" value="100"></div>

  <div class="sor">
    Miről:
    <label><input type="radio" name="mirol" value="HUF"> HUF</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="mirol" value="EUR"> EUR</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="mirol" value="USD"> USD</label>
  </div>

  <div class="sor">
    Mire:
    <label><input type="radio" name="mire" value="HUF"> HUF</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="mire" value="EUR"> EUR</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="mire" value="USD"> USD</label>
  </div>

  <div class="sor"><label><input type="checkbox" id="kedvezmeny"> 5% kedvezmény</label></div>

  <div class="sor">
    Kezelési díj:
    <select id="dij">
      <option value="0">0%</option>
      <option value="1">1%</option>
      <option value="2">2%</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <button onclick="valt()">Átvált</button>
  <p id="eredmeny"></p>
</div>

<script>
// ---------- how many forints is 1 unit ----------
function arfolyam(penznem) {
  if (penznem == "EUR") return 363.6;
  if (penznem == "USD") return 323.1;
  return 1;                                   // HUF
}

// ---------- show an error ----------
function hiba(szoveg) {
  document.getElementById("eredmeny").innerHTML = "<span class='hiba'>" + szoveg + "</span>";
}

// ---------- the main function (button) ----------
function valt() {
  // 1) READ
  let nev        = document.getElementById("nev").value;
  let osszeg     = Number(document.getElementById("osszeg").value);
  let mirolGomb  = document.querySelector("input[name='mirol']:checked");
  let mireGomb   = document.querySelector("input[name='mire']:checked");
  let kedvezmeny = document.getElementById("kedvezmeny").checked;
  let dij        = Number(document.getElementById("dij").value);

  // 2) CHECK (each one stops the function with return)
  if (nev == "")                         { hiba("Add meg a neved!"); return; }
  if (osszeg <= 0)                       { hiba("Az összeg legyen pozitív!"); return; }
  if (mirolGomb == null || mireGomb == null) { hiba("Válaszd ki a pénznemeket!"); return; }

  let mirol = mirolGomb.value;    // "HUF" / "EUR" / "USD"
  let mire  = mireGomb.value;

  // 3) CONVERT: from -> forint -> to
  let atvaltott = osszeg * arfolyam(mirol) / arfolyam(mire);

  // 4) FEE and DISCOUNT
  atvaltott = atvaltott * (1 + dij / 100);
  if (kedvezmeny) {
    atvaltott = atvaltott * 0.95;
  }

  // 5) SHOW: 2 decimals, comma instead of dot
  let szoveg = atvaltott.toFixed(2).replace(".", ",");
  document.getElementById("eredmeny").innerHTML =
    "<span class='jo'>" + nev + ": " + osszeg + " " + mirol + " = " + szoveg + " " + mire + "</span>";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

> 💡 **Adding another currency** (e.g. GBP): 1) add a radio button with `value="GBP"` to BOTH groups, 2) add `if (penznem == "GBP") return 420;` to `arfolyam()`. Done.

