## 12. "It doesn't work!" checklist

| Symptom                                   | Fix                                                                                                                               |
|-------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Nothing happens at all                    | F12 → Console. Read the red error and its line number.                                                                            |
| "Cannot read properties of null"          | The **id is wrong** (typo, or Capital vs small letter), or the script is ABOVE the element. Put `<script>` at the bottom of body. |
| "xyz is not defined"                      | Function name typo: `onclick="tippel()"` must match `function tippel()` exactly.                                                  |
| 5 + 3 gives 53                            | You forgot `Number()` around an input value.                                                                                      |
| Result is NaN                             | You did math with something that isn't a number (empty input, text).                                                              |
| if always true                            | You wrote `=` (sets the value) instead of `==` (compares).                                                                        |
| Whole page disappeared                    | `document.write` was called from a button. Use `innerHTML` instead.                                                               |
| Image not shown                           | Filename / capital letters / folder. See section 4.                                                                               |
| CSS does nothing                          | Missing **;** or **}**, wrong selector (`.` for class, `#` for id), or style.css not linked / not in the same folder.             |
| Box not centered vertically               | `height: 100vh;` missing on body.                                                                                                 |
| Absolute element flies to the page corner | The parent box needs `position: relative;`                                                                                        |
| Radio buttons can all be selected         | They need the SAME `name="..."`                                                                                                   |
| Missing ) or }                            | Every `(` `{` `"` must be closed. Count them.                                                                                     |

